            <div xml:id="m-e8e69c8d-2534-48b7-b7f2-43774cd7a2b5">
              <lg xml:id="m-302012d1-ac25-4796-bb01-41f6e94fcf8f">
                <l xml:id="m-c09ff6b4-7718-47e8-acba-93ce025dcfa2" facs="#m-407ec307-21f2-4a33-b77b-08b45cfd7deb" label="text-like">5th Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-995e8bee-2e56-4f32-bf77-1bde1e2fbdbc" facs="#m-d44deb8d-050a-4971-896d-3f18c0165f97" label="ambiguous">831</l><l xml:id="m-0d6d34bf-58c3-4718-aa0d-ecec1e3898b7" facs="#m-a09ce113-f09d-4cd4-94b9-7e24ee271a39" label="lyrics-like">é-jus. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-2987f8d7-a655-4a68-bdc0-a6fe5ff5d7ec" facs="#m-8fdf1e36-910f-478f-8c9b-e5cc06655306" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-d621ee25-4adb-4ba4-9672-7af5e75ec70f" facs="#m-3441af88-f04b-472b-a32a-46e343608b13" label="lyrics-like">Eus, a quo bona cuncta procé-] recta sunt; * et, te gubernánte,</l><l xml:id="m-ed817fab-afd0-4f35-857f-5d1a21315383" facs="#m-06938598-7e0c-408e-8ca4-e5f9651ec3b4" label="ambiguous">Udunt, largire supplicibus tuis:t</l><l xml:id="m-d60a65ef-517d-486d-a263-c82dea5d2c8f" facs="#m-0e269526-4c7d-47b5-8c1b-2c7d07055955" label="lyrics-like">léadem faciámus. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-8ce4fb33-4fda-4be4-ad59-76d2b34793cd" facs="#m-57729c0d-53c3-4c57-abe1-e42a7f336aee" label="lyrics-like">ut cogitémus, te inspiránte, quae! nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-14ef26e2-6446-47c6-aad5-b9596ead98b3" facs="#m-91e49d1f-a8b4-4416-b9b7-71b6232fce4b" label="text-like">2. Of Our Lady, p. 817. — 3. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 819.</l><l xml:id="m-cf8d070c-cdf9-4e13-911f-f6405d7bb694" facs="#m-f7aea5e0-54e8-43a0-a8ec-c95b8a6db0fb" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Jacobi Apostoli. Jac. T. a.</l><l xml:id="m-076cc930-226c-4936-b2dd-81ded069e761" facs="#m-f7a5c14d-2434-490d-97ba-0e0c1e31097a" label="lyrics-like">vArissimi: Estóte factóres verbi,! sed factor óperis: hic beátus in</l><l xml:id="m-0134ab19-8ec3-4c4e-88c2-09198173f7dc" facs="#m-54d1018a-3626-4877-a51e-7786cd0a3467" label="lyrics-like">L et non auditóres tantum: fal¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9f24ca0-1c26-45e4-ab5b-d4f890bba77f" facs="#m-3fc0f696-4a66-4601-81ca-fe8ba9032bf9" label="ambiguous">facto suo erit. Si quis autem putat</l><l xml:id="m-8d82f2f3-ee7d-4dd4-a427-2c34980034d4" facs="#m-bbe2926d-37fa-4635-a64f-d4cbe48f181e" label="lyrics-like">léntes vosmetípsos. Quia si quis</l><l xml:id="m-c9042d6e-993b-4d32-88af-0a82461dd4d1" facs="#m-83884046-2ab7-414f-aa1d-dc13469543ca" label="lyrics-like">se religiósum esse, non refraénans</l><l xml:id="m-c89f9ffa-279e-4c93-bae5-b7821b43126c" facs="#m-775bd592-c070-44ad-9d1b-2ebf9625b764" label="lyrics-like">linguam suam, sed sedúcens cor</l><l xml:id="m-5f8d5aa8-39a4-41b0-a30a-7ba6d8d07d5d" facs="#m-80c2cc81-02e3-4777-b8b6-033467518012" label="lyrics-like">audítor est verbi, et non factor: hic</l><l xml:id="m-a02ee263-0988-49b1-a098-adfa4053b742" facs="#m-d8739bc8-ba23-4f67-87e3-4a41682aacca" label="lyrics-like">comparábitur viro consideránti vul¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e961489-36e2-4a66-bf28-f4ea3b005ecd" facs="#m-fb7a9851-61f0-4327-9887-db9865d2ab90" label="lyrics-like">suum, hujus vana est relígio. Religio</l><l xml:id="m-e3ba0939-e476-44ba-8176-af98fcd98a0a" facs="#m-1458af7f-2023-4215-b4e4-fbd27ef9b490" label="lyrics-like">tum nativitátis suae in spéculo:</l><l xml:id="m-31a7450c-2bad-417c-94bf-fdf0731e390c" facs="#m-ced6e2df-d0e1-4740-be70-378d5c50dbc1" label="lyrics-like">munda, et immaculáta apud Deüm</l><l xml:id="m-bd77541c-5105-4033-912c-ed34e5d5b826" facs="#m-65464101-b22f-4a09-8256-a9701a9f696d" label="lyrics-like">considerávit enim se, et ábiit, et</l><l xml:id="m-eb5bf0f2-f981-46d6-8499-9c01c9f7bfe0" facs="#m-791d9a23-99b5-44a6-9c7b-01499bbcbe24" label="lyrics-like">et Patrem, haec est: Visitâre pu¬</l><l xml:id="m-aa9b3b26-e2d0-453a-bfb2-0161e24198d4" facs="#m-a1ff0e5b-c267-4a08-b54c-984da29a6058" label="lyrics-like">statim oblitus est qualis fúerit. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-87d3508c-388d-4014-b8f9-35030988dd22" facs="#m-89fa1523-4cf4-4d74-9558-c73ecfbb496b" label="lyrics-like">pillos, et víduas in tribulatióne eó¬</l><l xml:id="m-40c827cc-c0a7-4930-b58a-aa2d96778ce3" facs="#m-eabc2b45-6860-473b-8906-cdfb1add7392" label="lyrics-like">autem perspéxerit in legem perfé¬</l><l xml:id="m-10a8d163-9716-4241-af43-525e6c5bd959" facs="#m-83a14804-c8bd-4e47-9b69-a9bc1499f9ec" label="lyrics-like">rum, et immaculátum se custodire</l><l xml:id="m-9e86e6b7-a44d-46fe-99fb-a0fb162a9b06" facs="#m-997e9bf2-e325-45ce-ae83-fc706b741843" label="lyrics-like">ctam libertátis, et permánserit in</l><l xml:id="m-a4bd7f0b-1ac2-426c-9344-6fe7e2112b9e" facs="#m-bf82b0fe-cc1d-4ae6-961a-84eed2633a4f" label="lyrics-like">ab hoc saéculo.</l><l xml:id="m-967e9965-14d7-4585-bc37-605b5521e863" facs="#m-3dba9ebd-7c71-40cc-bd1a-26a2608d54c9" label="lyrics-like">ea, non audítor obliviosus factus,</l><l xml:id="m-b6213f32-e387-4d2a-8cc5-ec6b219dcb55" facs="#m-29e0b71d-bf51-43f5-b317-02633010d57e" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-a544c472-c023-4e9b-8895-bdb2aa385368" facs="#m-a9e2de97-0237-4a48-a4f6-60926493d970" label="ambiguous">h</l><l xml:id="m-333b9833-f6ca-46a5-9023-21a1a7887800" facs="#m-3045e2e0-b2ae-45fb-b0de-8852553a4d81" label="lyrics-like">lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-99564d86-1db7-4816-926b-e9675ff8116c" facs="#m-da037921-764d-4557-b2e7-23063264e531" label="ambiguous">ia. ij</l><l xml:id="m-87aa577c-e324-4943-a162-bcba6ee5da2d" facs="#m-35e24fb7-5920-412e-b839-78ed309d5d07" label="ambiguous">Lle¬</l><l xml:id="m-b2aa3156-e7bf-4a6f-b46c-87aed28408f1" facs="#m-1bac5412-d249-4993-a67f-c6cc81266643" label="ambiguous">il¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a5971c9-e55a-48b3-a3e9-587feff95237" facs="#m-ee11127b-f815-4d9e-b47e-3ece92081090" label="lyrics-like">V. Surré¬</l><l xml:id="m-414be1b8-1459-4842-8903-d2dc7a98b72b" facs="#m-5d5b1bcf-319e-4a2c-a603-4f7e582bc50d" label="ambiguous">xit Chri-stus.</l><l xml:id="m-21b4a2fe-262b-4928-a1bf-4d2230354a8d" facs="#m-c43fc21c-cecb-46ca-b14b-707904d556f2" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-6fccd9ce-686d-421b-82d0-f5d9c0d6a21e" facs="#m-a2354b43-aeda-4bba-b625-186b3ba0565f" label="lyrics-like">lú-xit</l><l xml:id="m-3bd38dce-24a4-45bf-a259-6f2c53e1b83c" facs="#m-ee47f81e-4166-4289-ae6f-baa4cb42c6f7" label="lyrics-like">nó-bis, quos redé¬</l><l xml:id="m-8be85495-e3c8-4936-92a3-1f10e8e6683b" facs="#m-a596fce6-90ce-4a2c-b5c5-0340070df635" label="lyrics-like">mit sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-106af05e-dcb4-46bb-8057-92ee38d15c56" facs="#m-12bfe593-cc98-4050-899a-e17b360e8870" label="ambiguous">gui-ne</l><l xml:id="m-5f484684-6ddc-4469-8ac3-31d4a0a49c29" facs="#m-0977eb15-6a35-4ff6-a1da-095b3e21d12a" label="lyrics-like">sú¬ o.</l><l xml:id="m-fbc5e2ac-c4f1-46d6-9f3d-047472107fdf" facs="#m-cf1f8132-6060-4ca7-8e2c-efe7f2753981" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-60c205c1-a2d0-4e37-b042-317fb9914878" facs="#m-f56e30cb-9d1a-4ed0-be84-62e6c4a052e3" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-2d84f7fa-e840-4c6f-a6e2-5a2133156af6" facs="#m-7fc8fc13-7370-438c-b72a-760be7daa2f7" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-893c1951-7f97-47f1-bd76-8c06b722ffde" facs="#m-795d7c9b-5707-4dd9-a81a-963eb97c0baf" label="ambiguous">L-le¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>